            "description": {
              "content": "Execute any GraphQL query, mutation, or introspection request against the DroneDeploy schema. The same endpoint serves the `viewer` query, the `node(id:)` interface, the `plans` connection on an organization, the `exports` connection on a MapPlan, and the `createExport` mutation (and other mutations exposed by the live schema).\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
